            "paragraph": "To study peat thickness and the subsoil, the elevations of the surface and the subsoil bottom were surveyed using an SIR-4000 (Geophysical Survey Systems, Inc.) ground penetrating radar (GPR) with a 200 MHz antenna, integrated into an all-terrain vehicle.",
